🚀 Level-5 Advanced Patterns
        Pattern 1️⃣2️⃣ HashMap + String Pattern
         👉 Used in anagram problems and frequency maps.
         Examples:
         1. Group Anagrams
         2. Check isomorphic strings
         3. First non-repeating character
         Pattern 1️⃣3️⃣ Regex / Pattern-Matching Pattern
         👉 Very powerful for filtering/validating strings.
         Examples:
         1. Validate email
         2. Validate mobile number
         3. Extract digits/words
        Pattern 1️⃣4️⃣ DP (Dynamic Programming) String Pattern
        👉 Hard but useful for interviews.
        Examples:
        1. Longest Palindromic Subsequence
        2. Edit Distance
        3. Word Break Problem
